  m_text: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatter symbols in any position triggers Free Games.\n-
    User can select between 2 Free Games options.\n   - Free Game Type 1: Royals
    are removed from the reels.\n   - Free Game Type 2: All way wins are multiplied
    by 3.\n- 3 or more Scatters during Free Games will award additional free games."
